version 0.14.0
component dc-005-20a

kind         part
mpn          DC-005-20A
manufacturer Korean Hroparts Elec
category     connector
datasheet    https://jlcpcb.com/partdetail/DC-005-20A/C136744
lcsc         C136744
description  Right-angle 2.0 mm DC power jack with switched sleeve contact
symbol       connectors:dc-005-20a
footprint    connector:dc-in-th-dc-005-20a

# The 500mA rating is below charger-power's stated 4A adapter limit; this jack is not rated for the design's full input current.
pins
  1  TIP     passive
  2  SLEEVE  passive
  3  SWITCH  passive

ratings
  rated_current  current  500mA
  voltage        voltage  30V
